~ start
Danilo: ...
Danilo: [center]For now, I’ll just head to the hangout first.[/center]
Danilo: [center]But... I have to pass through the graveyard on the way.[/center]
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(1, "Enter graveyard")
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

~ signage
Danilo: [center]So, I'll just have to go straight to the graveyard...[/center]
=> END

~ grave_entry
Danilo: [center][shake]I’m still scared to walk through here alone.[/shake][/center]
Danilo: [center][shake]But... I have no choice. I need to go through.[/shake][/center]
do Hud.clear_objectives()
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(2, "Find small hut")
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

~ smallhut_lock
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(2)
Danilo: [center]Locked? ...It wasn’t locked before.[/center]
Danilo: [center]Where could the key be?[/center]
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(3, "Look around to get clues")
=> END

~ no_key
Danilo: [center]I need to find the key first to open this.[/center]
=> END

~ unknown_sender_clue
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Ano ba unang nadaanan mo?")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]What did you pass first?
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Doon mo hanapin ang susi upang mabuksan ang pintuang ‘yan.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Look there for the key to open that door.
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(3)
do Hud.phone_outro()

Danilo: [center][shake]The key... in the graveyard?[/shake][/center]
Danilo: [center][shake]I don’t want to linger there.[/shake][/center]
Danilo: [center][shake]But... I also need the key to open this door.[/shake][/center]
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(4, "Search graveyard to get key")
=> END

