~ unknown_sender_paper_clue
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Ngayon, nakapasok ka na sa loob.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Now, you’re here.
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Hanapin mo mga kapiraso ng papel na 'yan.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Find all the fragments of that paper.
do Hud.phone_outro()

Danilo: [center]The fragments are inside the hangout.[/center]
Danilo: [center]I need to collect all of them to reconstruct the torn page from [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color]’s diary.[/center]
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(6, "Find all scattered paper inside small hut")
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

