~ enter_kwarto2
Danilo: [center]Hangout bedroom.[/center]
Danilo: [center]We used to nap here.[/center]
Danilo: [center]Me in the middle, Wendy to my right, and [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color] to my left.[/center]
